
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Service";
}

<!-- SUB BANNER -->
<section class="section-sub-banner bg-9">
    <div class="awe-overlay"></div>
    <div class="sub-banner">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="text text-center">
                <h2>Service &amp; Animates</h2>
                <p>Hotel Mishuk`s well-groomed, adroit team of staffs is always ready to provide 24 hours service. Please contact us if you required a service not listed.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<!-- END / SUB BANNER -->
<!-- ROOM -->
<section class="section-room bg-white">
    <div class="section">
        <div class="wrapper-inner">
            <!-- Services List -->
            <div class="widget-services-list">
                <div class="services-item">
                    <div class="item-photo">
                        <div class="photo-big" style="background-image: url('images/service/photo-services-1-1.jpg');"></div>
                        <div class="photo-small" style="background-image: url('images/service/photo-services-1-2.jpg');"></div>

                    </div>
                    <div class="item-desc">
                        <h5>OUR FACILITIES</h5>
                        <h2>Sky Bar &amp; Lounge</h2>
                        <p>Welcome to the enchanting world of the Sky Bar & Lounge, where luxury meets panoramic perfection. Nestled amongst the clouds on the uppermost floors of our prestigious hotel, the Sky Bar & Lounge offers an unparalleled experience that elevates your senses and spirits.</p>
                        <p>As you step into this elegant oasis, you'll be greeted by the soft glow of ambient lighting that accentuates the modern yet comfortable décor. The expansive windows offer breathtaking vistas of the cityscape, casting a spellbinding spell as you unwind in style. Whether you're a weary traveler seeking relaxation or a local resident looking for a sophisticated escape, the Sky Bar & Lounge caters to all.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="services-item">
                    <div class="item-photo">
                        <div class="photo-big" style="background-image: url('images/service/photo-services-2-1.jpg');"></div>
                        <div class="photo-small" style="background-image: url('images/service/photo-services-2-2.jpg');"></div>

                    </div>
                    <div class="item-desc">
                        <h5>OUR FACILITIES</h5>
                        <h2>Private Dining</h2>
                        <p>Step into a world of exquisite intimacy and culinary artistry with our hotel's Private Dining experience. Whether it's a romantic dinner for two, a family celebration, or a confidential business meeting, our Private Dining rooms offer the perfect setting for a truly personalized and memorable occasion.</p>
                        <p>Nestled away from the bustle of the main dining areas, these exclusive spaces are designed to provide an ambiance of sophistication and seclusion. Luxurious decor, soft lighting, and carefully curated details create an atmosphere that's both inviting and elegant, setting the stage for a remarkable dining experience.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="services-item">
                    <div class="item-photo">
                        <div class="photo-big" style="background-image: url('images/service/photo-services-3-1.jpg');"></div>
                        <div class="photo-small" style="background-image: url('images/service/photo-services-3-2.jpg');"></div>

                    </div>
                    <div class="item-desc">
                        <h5>OUR FACILITIES</h5>
                        <h2>Conference &amp; Events</h2>
                        <p>With a variety of venues to choose from, each offering its own unique ambiance, you can tailor your event to suit your vision and goals. Our modern meeting rooms are equipped with the latest audiovisual equipment, providing the perfect backdrop for impactful presentations and productive discussions.</p>
                        <p>Our team of experienced event planners will work closely with you to curate every detail, from arranging seating layouts to crafting bespoke menus that delight the palate. We understand that each event is a reflection of your unique requirements, and we are committed to exceeding your expectations.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="services-item">
                    <div class="item-photo">
                        <div class="photo-big" style="background-image: url('images/service/photo-services-4-1.jpg');"></div>
                        <div class="photo-small" style="background-image: url('images/service/photo-services-4-2.jpg');"></div>

                    </div>
                    <div class="item-desc">
                        <h5>OUR FACILITIES</h5>
                        <h2>Wedding Venue</h2>
                        <p>Imagine saying your vows beneath a canopy of twinkling lights in our lush garden, surrounded by the scent of blooming flowers and the gentle rustle of leaves. Or perhaps you envision a grand ballroom adorned with opulent décor, where you and your guests dance the night away in celebration of love.</p>
                        <p>Our dedicated team of wedding specialists is here to bring your vision to life, from planning every intricate detail to ensuring a seamless execution. We understand that every love story is unique, and our customizable packages allow you to create an experience that reflects your personalities and preferences.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Services List End -->
        </div>
    </div>

    </div>
</section>
<!-- END / ROOM -->